  - three visualization scripts;
  - two interactive HTML widgets: a "one-fifth landscape" where you can drag the parameters, delete a cost term or change the benefit-to-cost ratio, and a "covering lab" that checks the wall and plots any covering against it. Their JavaScript ran without errors on a simulated page; neither has been opened in a real browser;
